## Current identity summary
A cute pastel superhero-cat rapid tapping game with a 100-click target, timed completion, soft clouds/stars, particles, reaction badges, GIF overlays, and playful audio.

## Remix-direction summary
Transform presentation into `Rick & Morty: Portal Cat Panic`, where the moving cat target becomes an unstable portal-cat/dimensional beacon and the player charges a portal through 100 taps while visual worlds evolve.

